Package: multienrichjam
Type: Package
Title: Analysis and Visualization of Multiple Gene Set Enrichments
Version: 0.0.122.950
Authors@R: c(
   person(given=c("James", "M."),
      family="Ward",
      email="jmw86069@gmail.com",
      comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-9510-2848"),
      role=c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Maintainer: James M. Ward <jmw86069@gmail.com>
Description: Analysis of multiple gene set enrichment results,
   focused on pathway clustering driven by gene content,
   visualization of gene-pathway relationships, condensing
   redundant pathways to produce interpretable gene-pathway
   concept network graphs. Bipartite graphs render with edge
   bundling and efficient vectorized node rendering.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
